WEBVTT

00:08.862 --> 00:09.931
- ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.034 --> 00:11.758
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:11.862 --> 00:13.206
- I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:13.310 --> 00:15.000
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:15.103 --> 00:18.137
- ♪ OHH...
- ♪ 噢...

00:18.241 --> 00:20.275
♪ WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.379 --> 00:22.413
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:22.517 --> 00:24.310
- ♪ ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:24.413 --> 00:26.068
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:26.172 --> 00:28.310
- ♪ IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你所希望的 ♪

00:28.413 --> 00:30.034
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:30.137 --> 00:32.275
- ♪ THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH ♪
- ♪ 然后掉到甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:32.379 --> 00:34.206
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
- READY?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:34.310 --> 00:36.482
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:36.586 --> 00:38.172
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:38.275 --> 00:40.344
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:40.448 --> 00:41.344
- SPONGEBOB
- 海绵宝宝

00:41.448 --> 00:43.724
SQUAREPANTS!
方裤！

00:43.827 --> 00:45.344
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.448 --> 00:48.448
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

00:48.551 --> 00:49.551
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:52.586 --> 00:55.482
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:55.586 --> 01:01.413
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

01:01.517 --> 01:03.758
[bell rings]
[铃声响起]

01:05.068 --> 01:07.724
[both laugh]
[两人都笑了]

01:09.827 --> 01:11.034
[both chatting
indistinct]
[两人聊天
模糊]

01:11.137 --> 01:13.172
- HELLO.
- 你好。

01:16.137 --> 01:18.724
- OW!
- 噢！

01:18.827 --> 01:20.793
[both laugh]
[两人都笑了]

01:22.620 --> 01:25.241
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

01:27.551 --> 01:30.413
- BOY,
DO I LOVE HIGH SCHOOL.
- 男孩，
我喜欢高中吗？

01:30.517 --> 01:33.034
YOU KNOW WHAT? SOMEDAY
WE'RE GONNA REMEMBER ALL THIS,
你知道吗？有一天
我们会记住这一切，

01:33.137 --> 01:34.586
AND WE'RE GONNA
LOOK BACK AND SAY...
我们将会
回顾过去并说...

01:34.689 --> 01:36.896
"REMEMBER?"
“记住？”

01:37.000 --> 01:38.758
- [laughs]
SPEAKING OF REMEMBERING,
- [笑]
说到记忆，

01:38.862 --> 01:41.206
YOU DIDN'T FORGET THE
BIKINI BOTTOM HIGH SCHOOL DANCE
你没有忘记
比基尼泳装高中舞蹈

01:41.310 --> 01:42.206
IS TOMORROW NIGHT,
DID YOU?
明天晚上，
你有吗？

01:42.310 --> 01:43.620
- OF COURSE I DIDN'T FORGET.
- 我当然没有忘记。

01:43.724 --> 01:44.793
I'M SO EXCITED.
我太激动了。

01:44.896 --> 01:46.413
- UH-HUH, ME TOO.
- 嗯嗯，我也是。

01:46.517 --> 01:49.965
[both laugh]
[两人都笑了]

01:50.068 --> 01:51.000
BARNACLE.
藤壶。

01:51.103 --> 01:52.551
- WHAT?
- 什么？

01:52.655 --> 01:54.689
- PEARL, I'M GONNA SAY THIS
AS TACTFULLY AS POSSIBLE.
- 珍珠，我要说这个
尽可能巧妙。

01:54.793 --> 01:56.586
THERE'S A HIDEOUS BARNACLE
有一个可怕的藤壶

01:56.689 --> 01:58.827
GROWING OUT OF THE SIDE
OF YOUR FACE.
从侧面生长
你的脸。

01:58.931 --> 02:01.551
- WHERE?
- THERE.
- 在哪里？
- 那里。

02:01.655 --> 02:07.379
- WHAA!
- 哇！

02:07.482 --> 02:08.034
- SO ANYWAY,
I DON'T EVEN...
- 所以无论如何，
我什至不...

02:08.137 --> 02:12.172
[scream continues]
[尖叫声继续]

02:12.275 --> 02:14.620
- PEARL, IT'S NOT REALLY
AS BAD AS YOU--
- 珍珠，这不是真的
和你一样坏——

02:14.724 --> 02:17.586
- WHAA!
- 哇！

02:17.689 --> 02:18.931
- [whistling]
- [吹口哨]

02:19.034 --> 02:19.965
- SPONGEBOB.
- 海绵宝宝。

02:20.068 --> 02:21.413
- YES, MR. KRABS.
- 是的，先生。螃蟹。

02:21.517 --> 02:23.344
- DIDN'T YOU ALREADY
MOP THIS AREA?
- 你不是已经了吗
拖地这个区域？

02:23.448 --> 02:25.034
- AFFIRMATIVE, CAPTAIN.
- 是的，船长。

02:25.137 --> 02:27.172
- WELL THEN,
WHY WOULD YOU MOP IT AGAIN?
- 那么，
你为什么要再次拖它？

02:27.275 --> 02:29.586
- WHY WOULDN'T I?
- 我为什么不呢？

02:29.689 --> 02:31.103
- GOOD POINT.
- 好点。

02:31.206 --> 02:35.000
- [crying loudly]
- [大声哭泣]

02:35.103 --> 02:36.310
- PEARL!
- 珍珠！

02:36.413 --> 02:38.862
WHAT BRINGS YOU IN
ON SUCH A FINE AFTERNOON?
是什么让你进来的
在这样一个美好的下午？

02:38.965 --> 02:41.448
- OH, DADDY,
IT'S TERRIBLE.
- 哦，爸爸，
太可怕了。

02:41.551 --> 02:44.103
THE SCHOOL DANCE
IS THIS WEEKEND.
学校舞蹈
今天是周末吗？

02:44.206 --> 02:46.206
- OOH, THAT IS TERRIBLE.
- 哦，那太糟糕了。

02:46.310 --> 02:47.482
MAKES MY SHELL CRAWL
JUST THINKING ABOUT IT.
让我的壳爬行
只是想想而已。

02:47.586 --> 02:49.482
UGH.
啊。

02:49.586 --> 02:52.206
- NO, DADDY.
DON'T YOU UNDERSTAND?
- 不，爸爸。
你不明白吗？

02:52.310 --> 02:54.655
THE TERRIBLE PART IS THAT
I CAN'T GO TO THE DANCE.
可怕的是
我不能去参加舞会。

02:54.758 --> 02:57.448
- WHY EVER NOT?
- 为什么不呢？

02:57.551 --> 02:59.620
- BECAUSE I HAVE
A HIDEOUS BARNACLE
- 因为我有
可怕的藤壶

02:59.724 --> 03:01.620
GROWING ON THE SIDE
OF MY FACE!
副业成长
我的脸！

03:01.724 --> 03:03.034
- OH, HO, HO, HO,
- 哦，HO，HO，HO，

03:03.137 --> 03:05.655
NOW CALM DOWN THERE,
ME LITTLE PEARL.
现在冷静下来，
我，小珍珠。

03:05.758 --> 03:08.172
I'M SURE IT CAN'T BE
HALF AS AWFUL AS YOU--
我确信不可能
和你一样可怕——

03:08.275 --> 03:11.206
[gasps]
[喘气]

03:11.310 --> 03:13.689
GREAT RUSTY HINGE PIN
OF DAVY JONES' LOCKER!
伟大的生锈铰链销
戴维·琼斯的储物柜！

03:13.793 --> 03:17.000
- WE HAVE TO GET RID OF IT
NO MATTER WHAT IT TAKES.
- 我们必须摆脱它
无论如何。

03:17.103 --> 03:19.034
- ANYTHING FOR
ME BELOVED ANGEL.
- 一切为了
我心爱的天使。

03:19.137 --> 03:21.965
- OKAY, I NEED AN APPOINTMENT
WITH A DERMATOLOGIST,
- 好的，我需要预约
与皮肤科医生一起，

03:22.068 --> 03:26.034
A TRIP TO THE SPA,
EXPENSIVE CREAMS AND LOTIONS,
水疗之旅，
昂贵的面霜和乳液，

03:26.137 --> 03:27.448
AND PROBABLY
SOME OTHER KIND OF...
很可能
其他一些……

03:27.551 --> 03:30.034
- I MEANT WHATEVER YOU NEED
TO GET RID OF YOUR BLEMISH,
- 我的意思是无论你需要什么
为了消除你的瑕疵，

03:30.137 --> 03:31.931
NOT LIQUIDATE
ME RETIREMENT FUND.
不清算
我的退休基金。

03:32.034 --> 03:34.137
- [crying loudly]
- [大声哭泣]

03:34.241 --> 03:36.241
- YOU KNOW WHAT?
LET'S GO ACROSS THE STREET
- 你知道吗？
我们过马路吧

03:36.344 --> 03:37.620
TO THE CHUM BUCKET.
到鱼缸里去。

03:37.724 --> 03:39.793
- I HEARD THEY HAVE BETTER
WEATHER OVER THERE.
- 我听说他们有更好的
那边的天气。

03:39.896 --> 03:41.551
- NO! WAIT!
- 不！等待！

03:41.655 --> 03:43.793
THIS IS STARTING TO EAT AWAY
AT ME PROFIT MARGARINE.
这正在开始消失
对我来说，人造黄油是利润。

03:43.896 --> 03:45.448
IF I DON'T COME UP
WITH A SOLUTION FAST,
如果我不来
快速提供解决方案，

03:45.551 --> 03:47.000
IT'S GONNA COST ME A LOT MORE
这会让我付出更多的代价

03:47.103 --> 03:48.310
THAN A COUPLE OF CASES
OF COLD CREAM.
比几个案例
冷奶油。

03:48.413 --> 03:50.655
- ♪ LA, LA, LA,
LA, LA, LA, LA, LA, LA, LA ♪
- ♪ 洛杉矶，洛杉矶，洛杉矶，
洛杉矶，洛杉矶，洛杉矶，洛杉矶，洛杉矶，洛杉矶，洛杉矶♪

03:50.758 --> 03:53.793
- OH, SPONGEBOB,
HOW WOULD YOU LIKE TO--
- 哦，海绵宝宝，
您想怎样——

03:53.896 --> 03:54.827
AT EASE.
轻松自在。

03:54.931 --> 03:56.344
[bell dings]
[铃声]

03:56.448 --> 03:59.517
HOW WOULD YOU LIKE TO DO
YOUR DEAR OLD CHUM A FAVOR
你想怎么做
亲爱的老朋友，帮个忙

03:59.620 --> 04:03.241
AND RID HIS BEAUTIFUL DAUGHTER
OF HER EVIL BARNACLES?
并除掉他美丽的女儿
她邪恶的藤壶？

04:03.344 --> 04:05.034
- I WILL DO YOU THIS FAVOR,
SIR CHUM.
- 我会帮你这个忙，
查姆爵士。

04:05.137 --> 04:06.517
NEVER FEAR.
永远不要害怕。

04:06.620 --> 04:08.517
- I DON'T KNOW, SPONGEBOB.
- 我不知道，海绵宝宝。

04:08.620 --> 04:10.724
THE SCHOOL DANCE
IS RIGHT AROUND THE CORNER,
学校舞蹈
就在拐角处，

04:10.827 --> 04:13.551
AND THIS BARNACLE SEEMS TO BE
GETTING BIGGER BY THE MINUTE.
这个藤壶似乎是
分分钟变得更大。

04:13.655 --> 04:15.241
- [laughs]
TRUST ME, PEARL,
- [笑]
相信我，珍珠，

04:15.344 --> 04:17.103
WE'LL BE RID OF THAT THING
IN NO TIME.
我们会摆脱那件事
立刻。

04:17.206 --> 04:17.862
I KNOW JUST WHAT TO DO.
我知道该怎么做。

04:17.965 --> 04:20.103
- ARE YOU SURE?
- 你确定吗？

04:20.206 --> 04:21.655
- ONE TIME
MY FRIEND PATRICK,
- 一次
我的朋友帕特里克，

04:21.758 --> 04:24.551
HE HAD THIS BARNACLE THE SIZE
OF AN EXTRA-LARGE KRABBY PATTY
他有这个尺寸的藤壶
超大蟹肉饼

04:24.655 --> 04:26.413
RIGHT IN THE CENTER
OF HIS FOREHEAD.
就在中心
他的额头。

04:26.517 --> 04:30.103
ANYWAY, I FIXED IT SO HE NEVER
SAW THAT BARNACLE AGAIN.
无论如何，我修好了它，所以他永远不会
再次看到藤壶。

04:30.206 --> 04:32.620
- HOW?
- I TOOK HIM TO SEE A HYPNOTIST.
- 如何？
- 我带他去看催眠师。

04:32.724 --> 04:34.896
- YOU TOOK PATRICK
TO A HYPNOTIST?
- 你带走了帕特里克
催眠师？

04:35.000 --> 04:36.137
- UH-UH.
THE BARNACLE.
- 呃呃。
藤壶。

04:36.241 --> 04:37.724
IT BECAME CONVINCED
IT WAS A PELICAN
它变得确信了
这是一只鹈鹕

04:37.827 --> 04:39.103
AND FLEW SOUTH
FOR THE WINTER.
并向南飞去
冬季。

04:39.206 --> 04:41.137
WE NEVER SAW
THAT PELICAN AGAIN.
我们从未见过
又是那只鹈鹕。

04:41.241 --> 04:43.068
- I THOUGHT YOU SAID
IT WAS A BARNACLE.
- 我以为你说过
那是藤壶。

04:43.172 --> 04:47.000
- WHAT'D I SAY?
- PELICAN.
- 我说什么了？
- 鹈鹕。

04:47.103 --> 04:49.827
- HE WAS A REALLY GOOD
HYPNOTIST.
- 他真的很棒
催眠师。

04:49.931 --> 04:51.517
NOW JUST REMAIN CALM,
现在只要保持冷静，

04:51.620 --> 04:53.034
AND THIS WILL BE OVER
BEFORE YOU KNOW IT.
这一切都会结束
在您知道之前。

04:53.137 --> 04:54.000
- YOU'RE REALLY
GONNA USE HYPNOSIS
- 你真的
将使用催眠术

04:54.103 --> 04:56.965
TO GET RID OF THE BARNACLE?
摆脱藤壶？

04:57.068 --> 04:58.551
- HYPNOSIS?
NO.
- 催眠？
不。

04:58.655 --> 05:02.344
I'M JUST GONNA PRY IT OFF
WITH MY SPATULA.
我只是要把它撬下来
用我的抹刀。

05:02.448 --> 05:04.206
HOLD STILL NOW.
现在保持不动。

05:04.310 --> 05:08.379
[clanging]
[叮叮当当]

05:08.482 --> 05:10.517
- IS EVERYTHING OKAY?
- 一切都好吗？

05:10.620 --> 05:12.758
- I DON'T THINK
THE SPATULA'S GONNA WORK.
- 我不认为
抹刀会起作用。

05:12.862 --> 05:16.275
THIS OLD, WEATHER-BEATEN SHOVEL
OUGHT TO DO IT.
这把饱经风霜的旧铲子
应该这样做。

05:16.379 --> 05:19.413
[grunts]
[咕哝]

05:19.517 --> 05:20.931
- DID IT COME OFF?
- 它脱落了吗？

05:21.034 --> 05:22.241
- GETTING THERE.
- 到达那里。

05:22.344 --> 05:26.034
[jackhammer hammering]
[手提钻锤击]

05:26.137 --> 05:30.793
- SPONGEBOB,
HOW MUCH LONGER?
- 海绵宝宝，
还要多久？

05:30.896 --> 05:32.517
OH, SHOULDN'T BE
TOO MUCH LONGER.
哦，不应该
太长了。

05:36.413 --> 05:39.103
ACTUALLY, WE CAN TAKE A BREAK
NOW IF YOU WANT.
事实上，我们可以休息一下
如果你愿意的话，现在就可以。

05:39.206 --> 05:40.517
- GOOD IDEA.
- 好主意。

05:40.620 --> 05:43.724
I GOT TO GO SCRUB MY FACE DOWN
WITH SOAP AND WATER.
我得把脸朝下擦洗
用肥皂和水。

05:43.827 --> 05:45.655
- OKAY.
- 好的。

05:52.241 --> 05:55.724
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

05:55.827 --> 05:58.448
- PEARL!
- 珍珠！

05:58.551 --> 06:00.000
PEARL, WHAT HAPPENED?
珍珠，发生了什么事？

06:00.103 --> 06:03.172
- THERE'S MORE!
- 还有更多！

06:03.275 --> 06:04.827
- AAH!
- 啊啊！

06:04.931 --> 06:07.551
I MEAN, "YOU'RE RIGHT.
THERE ARE MORE."
我的意思是，“你是对的。
还有更多。”

06:07.655 --> 06:10.620
- ALL I DID WAS WASH
WITH SOAP AND WATER.
- 我所做的就是洗
用肥皂和水。

06:10.724 --> 06:14.206
- HMM.
WATER AND THIS SOAP?
- 唔。
水和肥皂？

06:14.310 --> 06:16.689
- YES, BUT WHY?
- 是的，但是为什么？

06:16.793 --> 06:20.206
- BECAUSE THIS SOAP
SMELLS SO WONDERFUL.
- 因为这个肥皂
闻起来太棒了。

06:20.310 --> 06:21.448
THAT'S WHY.
这就是原因。

06:21.551 --> 06:24.206
MM. I KNOW THAT FRAGRANCE
FROM SOMEWHERE.
毫米。我知道那种香味
来自某个地方。

06:24.310 --> 06:25.689
OH...
哦...

06:25.793 --> 06:27.206
OH, I'M SORRY.
DID YOU WANT A WHIFF?
哦，对不起。
您想闻一闻吗？

06:27.310 --> 06:29.379
- NO.
- 不。

06:29.482 --> 06:30.689
- MORE FOR ME.
- 对我来说更多。

06:32.517 --> 06:33.896
OKAY, PEARL.
好的，珍珠。

06:34.000 --> 06:36.206
- [muffled speech]
- [低声说话]

06:36.310 --> 06:39.482
- NO, I THINK ONE JAR
OF CONCEALING CREAM IS ENOUGH.
- 不，我想一罐
遮瑕霜就足够了。

06:39.586 --> 06:41.448
DON'T WORRY, PEARL.
NOBODY WILL NOTICE A THING.
别担心，珍珠。
没有人会注意到任何事情。

06:41.551 --> 06:43.827
- [whistling]
- [吹口哨]

06:43.931 --> 06:46.068
PEARL, I'M HOME!
珀尔，我回来了！

06:46.172 --> 06:47.034
[gasps]
[喘气]

06:47.137 --> 06:49.620
AAH!
啊啊！

06:49.724 --> 06:51.034
- SOMETHING WRONG,
MR. KRABS?
- 有问题，
先生。螃蟹？

06:51.137 --> 06:53.068
- FOR A SECOND THERE,
I THOUGHT A TOWERING, HIDEOUS,
- 有一秒钟，
我以为一座高耸的、丑陋的、

06:53.172 --> 06:55.379
MIND-BOGGLING ABOMINATION
WAS STANDING HERE,
令人难以置信的可憎之物
站在这里，

06:55.482 --> 06:57.034
STARING AT ME
IN ME OWN LIVING ROOM,
盯着我
在我自己的客厅里，

06:57.137 --> 06:58.724
BUT THEN I REALIZED
但后来我意识到

06:58.827 --> 07:01.965
IT'S JUST ME OWN,
BELOVED DAUGHTER PEARL.
这只是我自己的，
心爱的女儿珍珠。

07:02.068 --> 07:04.413
- [muffled speech]
- [低声说话]

07:04.517 --> 07:07.206
- OH, PEARL.
NO, NO, NO,
- 哦，珍珠。
不，不，不，

07:07.310 --> 07:09.517
NO EXPENSIVE TRIPS
TO THE SPA.
没有昂贵的旅行
去水疗中心。

07:09.620 --> 07:10.862
BUT DON'T WORRY.
但别担心。

07:10.965 --> 07:13.482
SPONGEBOB HERE
WILL TAKE CARE OF IT.
海绵宝宝在这里
会处理的。

07:13.586 --> 07:15.068
IF YOU TWO WILL EXCUSE ME,
如果你们两个能原谅我，

07:15.172 --> 07:19.241
I'VE GOT SOME IMPORTANT MATTERS
TO TAKE CARE OF.
我有一些重要的事情
照顾。

07:19.344 --> 07:21.758
[shouts indistinct]
[含糊不清地喊叫]

07:25.137 --> 07:25.931
- [crying loudly]
- [大声哭泣]

07:26.034 --> 07:28.275
- PEARL.
- 珍珠。

07:28.379 --> 07:29.620
PEARL,
YOU'VE BEEN IN THE BATHROOM
珍珠，
你去过卫生间

07:29.724 --> 07:30.793
CRYING FOR THREE HOURS NOW.
现在哭了三个小时。

07:30.896 --> 07:33.448
YOU CAN'T
STAY IN THERE FOREVER.
你不能
永远呆在那里。

07:33.551 --> 07:36.137
ALL RIGHT.
I'M COMING IN.
好的。
我进来了。

07:39.379 --> 07:42.310
- AAH!
- 啊啊！

07:42.413 --> 07:43.586
- LOOK AT THE BRIGHT SIDE,
PEARL.
- 看看光明的一面，
珍珠。

07:43.689 --> 07:45.551
AT LEAST YOU CAN STILL
PLAY THE PIANO.
至少你还可以
弹钢琴。

07:45.655 --> 07:48.172
- WELL, WHAT GOOD
WILL THAT DO ME?
- 嗯，有什么好处
这对我有用吗？

07:48.275 --> 07:51.620
- I HAVE NO IDEA.
- 我不知道。

07:51.724 --> 07:52.965
DON'T WORRY, PEARL.
别担心，珍珠。

07:53.068 --> 07:54.275
I'LL FIX YOUR PROBLEM.
我会解决你的问题。

07:54.379 --> 07:55.448
- HOW?
- 如何？

07:55.551 --> 07:57.379
- WELL, I'M SURE
IF I THINK HARD ENOUGH,
- 嗯，我确定
如果我认真思考的话

07:57.482 --> 07:59.689
SOMETHING'LL POP UP.
会弹出一些东西。

08:02.689 --> 08:05.793
OOPS.
I DIDN'T MEAN IT LIKE THAT.
哎呀。
我不是这个意思。

08:05.896 --> 08:11.862
HEY! IT'S THAT
DELICIOUS-SMELLING SOAP AGAIN.
嘿！就是这样
香皂再次出现。

08:11.965 --> 08:14.551
- WOULD YOU STOP
SMELLING MY SOAP?
- 你能停下来吗
闻到我的肥皂味了吗？

08:14.655 --> 08:16.482
WHY DON'T YOU GO
MAKE YOURSELF USEFUL
你为什么不走
让自己变得有用

08:16.586 --> 08:19.344
AND GET ME
ANOTHER BAR OF IT?
并得到我
另一个酒吧？

08:19.448 --> 08:21.689
- OKAY.
WHERE DO YOU KEEP YOUR SOAP?
- 好的。
你把肥皂放在哪里？

08:21.793 --> 08:25.241
- IN THE BASEMENT.
DUH. WHERE ELSE?
- 在地下室。
呃。还有哪里？

08:31.206 --> 08:33.206
[clunk]
[沉闷]

08:33.310 --> 08:35.275
- HELLO?
- 你好？

08:35.379 --> 08:36.482
[voice echoes]
[声音回声]

08:36.586 --> 08:39.068
[chains rattling]
[链条嘎嘎作响]

08:43.758 --> 08:45.344
SOMEBODY THERE?
有人吗？

08:45.448 --> 08:47.551
PEARL?
珍珠？

08:49.172 --> 08:53.068
[door creaks]
[门吱吱作响]

08:53.172 --> 08:54.413
UGH!
MR. KRABS.
啊！
先生。螃蟹。

08:54.517 --> 08:56.793
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

08:56.896 --> 08:58.310
DON'T JUST STAND THERE, BOY.
别只是站在那里，男孩。

08:58.413 --> 09:01.137
COME HELP ME WITH THIS.
来帮我吧。

09:01.241 --> 09:03.586
THERE WE GO.
我们开始了。

09:03.689 --> 09:05.931
SOMETIMES SHE JUST
GETS A LITTLE STUCK.
有时她只是
有点卡住了。

09:06.034 --> 09:07.482
- MR. KRABS,
WHAT IS THIS THING?
- 先生。螃蟹，
这是什么东西？

09:07.586 --> 09:09.724
- WHY,
IT'S ME OLD SOAP PRESS.
- 为什么，
这是我，旧肥皂机。

09:09.827 --> 09:11.517
- SOAP PRESS?
- THAT'S RIGHT.
- 肥皂压榨机？
- 这是正确的。

09:11.620 --> 09:12.896
ALL THE SOAP PEARL AND I USE
我和我用的所有肥皂珍珠

09:13.000 --> 09:14.448
COMES FROM THIS MACHINE.
来自这台机器。

09:14.551 --> 09:16.620
AND THE BEST PART IS...
最好的部分是......

09:16.724 --> 09:21.758
SHE RUNS ON 100% PURE
LEFTOVER KRABBY PATTIES.
她以 100% 纯粹的方式奔跑
剩下的蟹肉饼。

09:21.862 --> 09:24.620
- LEFTOVER KRABBY PATTIES?
- 剩下的蟹肉饼？

09:24.724 --> 09:25.862
[bell dings]
[铃声]

09:25.965 --> 09:28.793
- THEIR PRECIOUS ESSENCES
ARE HARVESTED,
- 他们的珍贵精华
被收获，

09:28.896 --> 09:30.931
AND AFTER A BRIEF
COOLING PROCESS,
简短介绍后
冷却过程，

09:31.034 --> 09:32.793
TRUNDLE OUT THIS CONVEYOR BELT
推出这条传送带

09:32.896 --> 09:35.620
AS FRESH,
WONDERFUL BARS OF SOAP.
新鲜，
很棒的肥皂。

09:35.724 --> 09:37.758
FRESH AND INVIGORATING.
清新活力。

09:37.862 --> 09:41.172
PLUS IT'S ABSOLUTELY FREE.
而且它完全免费。

09:41.275 --> 09:43.896
- OH, THAT'S WHY
IT SMELLED SO FAMILIAR.
- 哦，这就是为什么
闻起来很熟悉。

09:44.000 --> 09:45.413
HEY, I DON'T KNOW ABOUT THIS,
MR. KRABS.
嘿，我不知道这个，
先生。螃蟹。

09:45.517 --> 09:46.758
IF PEARL FINDS OUT--
如果珀尔发现了——

09:46.862 --> 09:48.862
- I'VE BEEN USING SOAP
- 我一直在用肥皂

09:48.965 --> 09:51.448
MADE OUT OF KRABBY PATTIES?
用蟹肉饼做的？

09:51.551 --> 09:54.379
- KRABBY PATTY ESSENCE.
- 蟹肉饼精华。

09:54.482 --> 09:56.620
- THAT'S GREASE!
- 那是油脂！

09:56.724 --> 09:58.931
- WELL, IF YOU WANT
TO SPLIT HAIRS, I SUPPOSE--
- 好吧，如果你愿意的话
为了分裂头发，我想——

09:59.034 --> 10:02.068
- DADDY!
- 爸爸！

10:02.172 --> 10:05.206
- GOT TO GO.
YOU KIDS HAVE FUN.
- 得走了。
你们孩子玩得很开心。

10:05.310 --> 10:08.034
- [crying]
- [哭泣]

10:08.137 --> 10:11.655
I'M NEVER GONNA BE ABLE
TO GET THESE BARNACLES OFF.
我永远做不到
把这些藤壶弄掉。

10:11.758 --> 10:14.551
MY YOUNG LIFE
IS RUINED FOREVER.
我年轻的生活
永远被毁了。

10:14.655 --> 10:15.827
- DON'T WORRY, PEARL.
- 别担心，珀尔。

10:15.931 --> 10:18.172
I SAID I WAS NOT
GOING TO LET MR. KRABS DOWN,
我说我不是
打算让先生。螃蟹下来，

10:18.275 --> 10:19.379
AND I'M NOT GOING TO.
我不会这么做。

10:19.482 --> 10:21.000
WHAT DO YOU THINK OF THAT?
您对此有何看法？

10:25.068 --> 10:27.034
- THE BIKINI BOTTOM
HIGH SCHOOL DANCE
- 比基尼下装
高中舞蹈

10:27.137 --> 10:30.344
WAS SUPPOSED TO BE
MY CHANCE TO SPARKLE.
本来应该是
我闪耀的机会。

10:30.448 --> 10:31.275
MY--
- WAIT A MINUTE, PEARL.
我的--
- 等一下，珀尔。

10:31.379 --> 10:32.000
SAY THAT AGAIN.
再说一遍。

10:32.103 --> 10:33.931
- OKAY.
- 好的。

10:34.034 --> 10:35.862
THE BIKINI BOTTOM
HIGH SCHOOL DANCE
比基尼泳裤
高中舞蹈

10:35.965 --> 10:37.379
WAS SUPPOSED TO BE
MY CHANCE TO SPARKLE.
本来应该是
我闪耀的机会。

10:37.482 --> 10:39.827
- O--OKAY, YOU CAN STOP.
- 哦——好吧，你可以停下来了。

10:39.931 --> 10:43.620
I THINK I HAVE AN IDEA.
我想我有一个主意。

10:43.724 --> 10:45.241
- ARE YOU DONE YET?
- 你完成了吗？

10:45.344 --> 10:46.620
- ALL SET.
- 一切就绪。

10:46.724 --> 10:48.241
CLOSE YOUR EYES
闭上你的眼睛

10:48.344 --> 10:50.172
AND GET READY TO SPARKLE.
准备好闪耀吧。

10:50.275 --> 10:52.517
ONE, TWO, THREE.
一二三。

10:52.620 --> 10:54.586
TA-DA!
WHAT DO YOU THINK?
达达！
你怎么认为？

10:54.689 --> 10:57.379
- I--I DON'T KNOW,
SPONGEBOB.
- 我--我不知道，
海绵宝宝。

10:57.482 --> 10:59.310
WHAT WILL MY FRIENDS SAY?
我的朋友会怎么说？

10:59.413 --> 11:02.137
- WE SHALL SEE FORTHWITH.
- 我们很快就会看到。

11:02.241 --> 11:03.137
- ARE YOU SURE?
- 你确定吗？

11:03.241 --> 11:06.344
- SHH. TRUST ME.
-嘘。相信我。

11:06.448 --> 11:09.827
- PEARL, WE'RE HERE
TO PICK YOU UP FOR THE--WOW!
- 珍珠，我们在这里
来接你——哇！

11:09.931 --> 11:12.586
PEARL,
YOU LOOK AMAZING.
珍珠，
你看起来棒极了。

11:12.689 --> 11:14.172
- I DO?
- 我愿意？

11:14.275 --> 11:16.137
- WELL, NO,
ACTUALLY NOT AMAZING.
- 嗯，不，
实际上并不令人惊奇。

11:16.241 --> 11:18.896
SPARKLING AND SHINY
AND AMAZING!
闪闪发光
太棒了！

11:19.000 --> 11:22.827
- WHEE! TO THE BIKINI BOTTOM
HIGH SCHOOL DANCE!
- 哇！到比基尼底部
高中舞蹈！

11:22.931 --> 11:26.827
[laughter]
all: LET'S GO!
[笑声]
全体：我们走吧！

11:26.931 --> 11:28.793
- HAVE A GOOD TIME,
CAREFREE TEENS.
- 祝你玩得愉快
无忧无虑的青少年。

11:28.896 --> 11:31.896
- AAH!
ME JEWELS!
- 啊啊！
我的珠宝！

11:32.000 --> 11:35.034
SPONGEBOB, ME ENTIRE COLLECTION
OF PRECIOUS JEWELS IS GONE!
《海绵宝宝，我》全集
珍贵的珠宝不见了！

11:35.137 --> 11:37.172
HAVE YOU SEEN IT?
- OF COURSE.
你见过吗？
- 当然。

11:37.275 --> 11:39.758
PEARL'S WEARING IT TO THE
BIKINI BOTTOM HIGH SCHOOL DANCE.
珍珠的穿着
比基尼下高中舞蹈。

11:39.862 --> 11:42.275
- HELP!
POLICE! THIEF!
- 帮助！
警察！贼！

11:42.379 --> 11:45.034
STOP THAT WHALE!
阻止那头鲸鱼！

11:45.137 --> 11:47.655
- I PROMISED MR. KRABS
I WOULDN'T LET HIM DOWN,
- 我答应过先生蟹蟹
我不会让他失望，

11:47.758 --> 11:50.275
AND I HAVE PARTIALLY
FULFILLED THAT PROMISE.
我已经部分
履行了这一承诺。

11:52.586 --> 11:55.655
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

11:55.758 --> 12:01.862
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

12:06.068 --> 12:08.310
- OH, BOY!
THE MAIL'S HERE!
- 哦，孩子！
邮件在这里！

12:08.413 --> 12:09.586
WHAT DO WE HAVE TODAY?
今天我们有什么？

12:09.689 --> 12:12.241
GAS BILL.
TAXES.
煤气费。
税收。

12:12.344 --> 12:15.413
LETTER TO SPONGEBOB
FROM GRAMMA!
给海绵宝宝的信
来自语法！

12:26.724 --> 12:28.793
- AW, GRAMMA'S
TURNING EVEN OLDER.
- AW，语法
变得更老了。

12:28.896 --> 12:32.103
I CAN'T WAIT TO CELEBRATE!
WHOA.
我迫不及待地想庆祝！
哇哦。

12:32.206 --> 12:33.275
- [meows]
- [喵]

12:33.379 --> 12:34.310
- SORRY, GARY.
- 对不起，加里。

12:34.413 --> 12:35.793
I AM GONNA MISS YOU
WHILE I'M GONE.
我会想念你的
当我离开时。

12:35.896 --> 12:37.344
[duck quacks]
[鸭子嘎嘎叫]

12:37.448 --> 12:40.689
BUT IF I'M NOT HERE,
WHO'S GONNA TAKE CARE OF YOU?
但如果我不在这里，
谁来照顾你？

12:40.793 --> 12:43.275
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

12:43.379 --> 12:45.310
- [high-pitched voice]
HI, SQUIDWARD!
- [高亢的声音]
嗨，章鱼哥！

12:45.413 --> 12:46.551
MY DADDY IS GOING AWAY.
我爸爸要走了。

12:46.655 --> 12:50.103
CAN YOU TAKE CARE OF ME--OW?
你能照顾我吗——哦？

12:50.206 --> 12:51.448
[laughs]
[笑]

12:51.551 --> 12:53.931
- OH, NO.
NO WAY.
- 哦，不。
决不。

12:54.034 --> 12:55.965
LOOK WHAT THAT DISGUSTING PEST
看看那是什么恶心的害虫

12:56.068 --> 12:58.448
DID TO MY SUSTAINABLE
KELP GARDEN.
对我的可持续发展做了
海带花园。

12:58.551 --> 13:00.413
HE CHEWED IT UP.
RUINED IT.
他把它嚼碎了。
毁了它。

13:00.517 --> 13:04.172
- GARY, IS THAT TRUE?
- 加里，这是真的吗？

13:04.275 --> 13:07.137
WELL, I'LL SEE YOU LATER,
SQUIDWARD.
好吧，稍后见，
章鱼哥。

13:07.241 --> 13:10.379
PATRICK!
帕特里克！

13:10.482 --> 13:11.517
PATRICK?
帕特里克？

13:11.620 --> 13:14.655
- [muttering indistinct]
- [含糊不清的咕哝]

13:14.758 --> 13:15.896
- PATRICK,
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?
- 帕特里克，
你在做什么？

13:16.000 --> 13:18.827
- I'M TALKING TO MY FRIEND,
FUNNY.
- 我正在和我的朋友说话，
有趣。

13:18.931 --> 13:21.758
HI, FUNNY.
嗨，有趣。

13:21.862 --> 13:23.000
- HA, YEAH.
- 哈，是的。

13:23.103 --> 13:24.448
UH, PATRICK,
I NEED TO ASK A FAVOR OF YOU.
呃，帕特里克，
我需要请你帮忙。

13:24.551 --> 13:25.689
- WHAT IS IT?
- 这是什么？

13:25.793 --> 13:26.620
- I NEED YOU
TO TAKE CARE OF GARY.
- 我需要你
照顾加里。

13:26.724 --> 13:28.241
- ARE YOU GOING OFF THE GRID?
- 你要脱离电网吗？

13:28.344 --> 13:30.172
- WHAT?
- 什么？

13:30.275 --> 13:33.172
- DON'T WORRY.
I KNOW WHAT TO DO.
- 不用担心。
我知道该怎么做。

13:33.275 --> 13:34.862
YOU'RE GONNA NEED
ONE OF THESE.
你会需要
其中之一。

13:34.965 --> 13:36.379
- NO, THAT'S NOT IT.
- 不，不是这样。

13:36.482 --> 13:38.862
I AM GOING TO SEE
MY GRANDMA FOR HER BIRTHDAY,
我要去看看
我奶奶的生日，

13:38.965 --> 13:41.206
AND I'M TRUSTING MY BEST PAL
我信任我最好的朋友

13:41.310 --> 13:44.206
TO WATCH CAREFULLY OVER GARY
WHILE I'M GONE.
仔细观察加里
当我离开时。

13:44.310 --> 13:47.137
- YOU GOT IT.
HE'S SAFE WITH ME!
- 你明白了。
他和我在一起很安全！

13:47.241 --> 13:50.551
[meows]
[喵喵]

13:50.655 --> 13:52.620
- OKAY, PATRICK.
HERE YA ARE.
- 好吧，帕特里克。
你在这里。

13:52.724 --> 13:54.862
- WHAT'S THAT?
- 那是什么？

13:54.965 --> 13:56.137
- IT'S A CHRONOLOGICAL LIST
- 这是一个按时间顺序排列的列表

13:56.241 --> 13:57.896
OF ALL THE THINGS
YOU HAVE TO DO WITH GARY.
万物之灵
你必须和加里打交道。

13:58.000 --> 14:00.310
MAKE SURE YOU DO
EACH AND EVERY ONE.
确保你这样做
每一位。

14:00.413 --> 14:01.965
- GOT IT.
- 知道了。

14:02.068 --> 14:04.241
HEY, DO YOU HAVE
ANY MORE OF THOSE
嘿，你有吗
还有更多这些吗

14:04.344 --> 14:07.137
DEEP-FRIED, CREAM-FILLED,
SUGAR-COATED CORAL BALLS?
油炸，奶油夹心，
糖衣珊瑚球？

14:07.241 --> 14:09.482
- OH, YEAH.
THEY'RE IN THE CABINET.
- 哦，是的。
他们在内阁里。

14:09.586 --> 14:13.413
- OH. CORAL BALLS.
- 哦。珊瑚球。

14:13.517 --> 14:15.379
- [sniffs]
I'M GONNA MISS YOU, LITTLE GUY.
- [嗅嗅]
我会想念你的，小家伙。

14:15.482 --> 14:17.482
BUT I KNOW YOU ARE
GONNA BE IN GOOD HANDS.
但我知道你是
将会得到良好的照顾。

14:17.586 --> 14:19.034
- [laughs]
- [笑]

14:19.137 --> 14:23.448
YOU CAN'T GET TO MY STOMACH
THAT WAY, CORAL BALL.
你够不到我的肚子
这样，珊瑚球。

14:23.551 --> 14:27.137
- OKAY, GARY.
I'LL BE HOME BY 10:00.
- 好吧，加里。
我会在 10:00 之前到家。

14:27.241 --> 14:29.862
UH, PATRICK,
JUST TO VERIFY,
呃，帕特里克，
只是为了验证，

14:29.965 --> 14:32.413
FIRST YOU FEED GARY,
THEN YOU PET GARY,
首先你喂加里，
那么你宠物加里，

14:32.517 --> 14:33.655
THEN YOU BA--
那么你吧——

14:33.758 --> 14:35.206
- SPONGEBOB,
DON'T YOU TRUST ME?
- 海绵宝宝，
你不相信我吗？

14:35.310 --> 14:37.965
I AM THE MOST RESPONSIBLE
GUY YOU KNOW.
我是最有责任的
你认识的人。

14:38.068 --> 14:39.689
- YOU KNOW WHAT?
YOU'RE RIGHT.
- 你知道吗？
你说得对。

14:39.793 --> 14:41.517
- WELL, OF COURSE I AM.
- 嗯，我当然是。

14:41.620 --> 14:44.448
NOW GO SEE YOUR GRANDMA.
现在去看你的奶奶。

14:44.551 --> 14:47.448
GARY'S IN GOOD HANDS.
加里得到了良好的照顾。

14:47.551 --> 14:50.310
YEP. LOOKS LIKE IT'S JUST
YOU AND ME, FRIEND.
是的。看起来只是这样
你和我，朋友。

14:50.413 --> 14:51.793
- [meows]
- [喵]

14:51.896 --> 14:56.000
- HMM. I WONDER
WHAT WE SHOULD DO FIRST.
- 唔。我想知道
我们首先应该做什么。

14:58.137 --> 15:00.827
YOU NEED TO WORK ON
YOUR HANDWRITING, SPONGEBOB.
你需要努力
你的笔迹，海绵宝宝。

15:00.931 --> 15:02.758
AH,
I DON'T NEED THIS ANYWAY.
啊，
无论如何我不需要这个。

15:02.862 --> 15:05.551
OOH, I KNOW.
LET'S GO FOR A WALK.
哦，我知道。
我们去散步吧。

15:05.655 --> 15:09.241
- [pants]
- [裤子]

15:09.344 --> 15:10.482
- OH.
- 哦。

15:10.586 --> 15:13.517
LOOKS LIKE MY TUMMY
IS HAVING AN ARGUMENT
看起来像我的肚子
正在争论

15:13.620 --> 15:15.482
WITH THE CORAL BALLS.
与珊瑚球。

15:15.586 --> 15:17.758
OH...
哦...

15:21.931 --> 15:24.413
[toilet flushes]
[厕所冲水]

15:24.517 --> 15:28.965
AH. BETTER.
啊。更好的。

15:29.068 --> 15:32.310
- [meows]
- [喵]

15:32.413 --> 15:33.827
- OH, HEY, FRIEND.
WHAT'S UP?
- 哦，嘿，朋友。
这是怎么回事？

15:33.931 --> 15:37.034
- [meows]
- [喵]

15:37.137 --> 15:39.448
[stomach growls]
[肚子咕咕叫]

15:42.482 --> 15:45.000
[moans]
[呻吟声]

15:45.103 --> 15:47.241
- STEP ASIDE, BARRY.
- 退到一边，巴里。

15:47.344 --> 15:49.310
LET ME SHOW YOU
HOW IT'S DONE.
让我告诉你
它是如何完成的。

15:49.413 --> 15:50.241
HUP!
哈普！

15:54.482 --> 15:56.275
OOH.
LET ME TRY A BITE OF THIS.
哦。
让我尝尝这个。

16:01.758 --> 16:02.931
[belches]
[打嗝]

16:03.034 --> 16:03.931
GOOD STUFF.
好东西。

16:04.034 --> 16:06.379
- [grumbles]
- [抱怨]

16:06.482 --> 16:10.586
- OOH. I WONDER WHAT SPONGEBOB'S
GOT FOR ME IN THE FRIDGE.
-哦。我想知道海绵宝宝是什么
冰箱里给我的。

16:10.689 --> 16:15.034
- I HOPE YOU SAVED ROOM
FOR DESSERT, SPONGEBOB.
- 我希望你能节省房间
甜点是《海绵宝宝》。

16:15.137 --> 16:17.724
- OH, GRAMMA,
YOU SHOULDN'T HAVE.
- 哦，奶奶，
你不应该这样做。

16:17.827 --> 16:20.413
IT'S YOUR BIRTHDAY.
I SHOULD BE SERVING YOU.
今天是你的生日。
我应该为你服务。

16:20.517 --> 16:23.517
- AW. I KNOW HOW MUCH
YOU LOVE SWEETS,
- AW。我知道多少
喜欢甜食的你，

16:23.620 --> 16:27.551
AND I KNOW HOW MUCH YOU LOVE
YOUR PET SNAIL,
我知道你有多爱
您的宠物蜗牛，

16:27.655 --> 16:31.551
SO I MADE YOU
THIS SPECIAL GELATIN MOLD.
所以我创造了你
这种特殊的明胶模具。

16:31.655 --> 16:33.793
- GARY.
OH, GARY.
- 加里。
哦，加里。

16:33.896 --> 16:35.931
- HE'S SAFE WITH ME!
- 他和我在一起很安全！

16:36.034 --> 16:38.896
- [meows]
- [喵]

16:39.000 --> 16:40.206
- GRAMMA,
CAN I PLEASE USE YOUR PHONE?
- 语法，
我可以使用你的电话吗？

16:40.310 --> 16:44.586
- OF COURSE.
- THANK YOU!
- 当然。
- 谢谢你！

16:44.689 --> 16:45.482
- HELLO.
- 你好。

16:45.586 --> 16:46.655
- PATRICK,
IT'S SPONGEBOB.
- 帕特里克，
这是海绵宝宝。

16:46.758 --> 16:47.655
HOW'S GARY?
加里怎么样？

16:47.758 --> 16:48.655
- G--OH, GARY.
- G--哦，加里。

16:48.758 --> 16:50.896
UH, YEAH, HE'S FINE.
呃，是的，他很好。

16:51.000 --> 16:52.586
- [meows]
- [喵]

16:52.689 --> 16:54.379
[stomach grumbles]
[肚子咕咕叫]

16:54.482 --> 16:56.310
- [laughs]
- [笑]

16:56.413 --> 16:59.896
[Patrick laughing,
Gary groaning]
[帕特里克笑道，
加里呻吟]

17:00.000 --> 17:01.586
- [laughs]
- [笑]

17:01.689 --> 17:04.034
OH, SOUNDS LIKE YOU
GOT EVERYTHING UNDER CONTROL.
哦，听起来像你
一切尽在掌控之中。

17:04.137 --> 17:05.965
OH, MAKE SURE
TO GIVE GARY HIS BATH.
哦，请确保
给加里洗澡。

17:06.068 --> 17:08.172
[mutters happily]
[高兴地嘀咕]

17:11.068 --> 17:12.862
- [sniffs]
- [嗅嗅]

17:12.965 --> 17:15.482
OOH.
SPONGEBOB WAS RIGHT.
哦。
海绵宝宝是对的。

17:15.586 --> 17:17.482
YOU NEED A BATH.
你需要洗澡。

17:24.862 --> 17:28.724
OH, I ALMOST FORGOT.
哦，我差点忘了。

17:28.827 --> 17:30.586
[bell dings]
SNAIL FOOD!
[铃声]
蜗牛食物！

17:30.689 --> 17:34.241
- [meows excitedly]
- [兴奋地喵喵叫]

17:34.344 --> 17:38.827
- WELL, YOU GOT TO GET THE WATER
TO STAY IN THERE SOMEHOW.
- 好吧，你得去拿水
以某种方式留在那儿。

17:38.931 --> 17:41.862
NOW, GARY,
WE DON'T EAT THE BATH.
现在，加里，
我们不吃洗澡水。

17:41.965 --> 17:46.103
WE GET IN THE BATH.
我们进浴室。

17:46.206 --> 17:47.551
COME ON, GARY.
来吧，加里。

17:47.655 --> 17:49.206
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

17:49.310 --> 17:50.862
- OH, DON'T BE DIFFICULT
NOW, GARY.
- 哦，别难
现在，加里。

17:50.965 --> 17:52.517
- [meows]
- [喵]

17:52.620 --> 17:54.689
- GARY!
- 加里！

17:54.793 --> 17:56.551
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

17:56.655 --> 17:57.068
- THERE YOU ARE!
- 你来了！

17:57.172 --> 17:59.551
- [meows]
- [喵]

17:59.655 --> 18:01.448
- OOP--OOF!
- 哎呀——哎呀！

18:10.172 --> 18:11.068
[telephone rings]
[电话铃声]

18:11.172 --> 18:12.931
- WHAT NOW?
- 现在怎么办？

18:13.034 --> 18:15.000
SQUAREPANTS HOUSEHOLD.
方丈一家。

18:15.103 --> 18:16.724
- YEAH, PATRICK,
ABOUT GARY'S BATH,
- 是的，帕特里克，
关于加里的浴室，

18:16.827 --> 18:18.586
MAKE SURE THE BATHWATER'S
NOT TOO HOT,
确保洗澡水的
不太热，

18:18.689 --> 18:20.241
AND HE DOESN'T LIKE
TOO MANY BUBBLES.
他不喜欢
气泡太多。

18:20.344 --> 18:21.482
- YEAH, YEAH.
- 是啊是啊。

18:21.586 --> 18:22.896
AND REMEMBER TO DRY HIM OFF
REALLY GOOD.
记得把他擦干
真的很好。

18:23.000 --> 18:24.000
- ALL RIGHT.
- 好的。

18:24.103 --> 18:25.275
- AND DON'T FORGET
ABOUT THE LIST.
- 不要忘记
关于名单。

18:25.379 --> 18:26.793
- OKAY,
I GET IT, SPONGEBOB!
- 好吧，
我明白了，海绵宝宝！

18:26.896 --> 18:28.448
I GET IT!
I GET IT!
我得到它！
我得到它！

18:30.689 --> 18:33.379
OH!
哦！

18:43.551 --> 18:47.413
[grunts]
[咕哝]

18:47.517 --> 18:49.517
I DON'T GET THESE
NEWFANGLED SHOWERHEADS.
我不明白这些
新奇的淋浴喷头。

18:49.620 --> 18:52.758
GARY!
加里！

18:52.862 --> 18:55.413
TIME FOR YOU BA--
是时候给你了，BA——

18:55.517 --> 18:57.068
WAIT A MINUTE, PATRICK.
等一下，帕特里克。

18:57.172 --> 18:59.310
WE GOT TO TRICK THE SNAIL.
我们得欺骗蜗牛。

18:59.413 --> 19:02.517
YOU GOT TO BE
"SMARTERER" THAN HIM.
你必须成为
比他“更聪明”。

19:02.620 --> 19:07.379
HEY, BUDDY. I GOT SOMETHING
COOL TO SHOW YA.
嘿，伙计。我有东西
很酷的展示给你看。

19:07.482 --> 19:11.344
AND IT'S THE OPPOSITE
OF A WET, WATERY BATH.
事实恰恰相反
湿漉漉的水浴。

19:11.448 --> 19:12.551
CHECK IT OUT!
一探究竟！

19:19.103 --> 19:22.000
DOESN'T THAT LOOK FUN?
这看起来不是很有趣吗？

19:22.103 --> 19:23.413
[tires screech]
[轮胎尖叫声]

19:23.517 --> 19:24.862
WELL, MAKE UP YOUR MIND.
好吧，你拿定主意吧。

19:24.965 --> 19:29.620
IS IT WATER OR FIRE?
是水还是火？

19:29.724 --> 19:30.724
[cans clatter]
[罐头碰撞声]

19:30.827 --> 19:32.482
OKAY, GARY.
好的，加里。

19:32.586 --> 19:34.551
IF YOU DON'T
COME TO THE BATH,
如果你不这样做
来洗澡吧，

19:34.655 --> 19:37.655
THEN THE BATH'S
GONNA COME TO YOU.
然后是浴室
会来找你的。

19:38.931 --> 19:40.620
THAT'S A GOOD BOY.
这是个好孩子。

19:40.724 --> 19:44.758
NOW SUDS UP.
现在起泡了。

19:44.862 --> 19:46.517
- [garbled meowing]
- [混乱的喵喵声]

19:53.206 --> 19:55.448
- THAT WASN'T SO BAD,
NOW WAS IT?
- 那还不错，
现在是吗？

19:58.482 --> 20:00.862
OH,
NOW WE GOT TO DRY YOU OFF.
哦，
现在我们得把你擦干。

20:00.965 --> 20:02.137
HUH.
呵呵。

20:02.241 --> 20:04.344
UNFORTUNATELY,
I COULDN'T FIND ANY SALT,
不幸的是，
我找不到任何盐，

20:04.448 --> 20:06.896
SO I'LL HAVE TO USE
THE NEXT BEST THING.
所以我必须使用
下一个最好的事情。

20:11.793 --> 20:15.275
THERE.
DOESN'T THAT FEEL BETTER?
那里。
是不是感觉好多了？

20:15.379 --> 20:17.137
OKAY.
LET'S SEE.
好的。
让我们来看看。

20:17.241 --> 20:18.862
GARY'S EATEN,
HE'S HAD HIS BATH.
加里被吃了，
他洗完澡了。

20:18.965 --> 20:24.482
TIME TO WATCH THE TV!
是时候看电视了！

20:24.586 --> 20:25.379
[snores]
[打鼾]

20:46.241 --> 20:48.344
OH, SHEESH, GARY.
哦，希什，加里。

20:48.448 --> 20:50.206
WELL,
IF YOU WANTED ANOTHER BATH,
嗯，
如果您想再洗一次澡，

20:50.310 --> 20:52.068
WHY DIDN'T YOU JUST ASK?
你为什么不直接问？

20:52.172 --> 20:53.517
- [meows]
- [喵]

20:59.862 --> 21:02.068
- ♪ HAPPY BIRTHDAY,
DEAR OLD GRAMMA, GRAMMA ♪
- ♪ 生日快乐，
DEAR OLD GRAMMA, GRAMMA ♪

21:02.172 --> 21:03.241
♪ GRAMMA
♪ 语法

21:03.344 --> 21:03.931
♪ THE BEST GRAMMA
IN THE WORLD ♪
♪ 最好的语法
在这个世界上♪

21:04.034 --> 21:06.137
♪ GRAMMA, GRAMMA
♪ 语法，语法

21:06.241 --> 21:09.344
- OH, DEAR.
LOOK AT ALL THOSE CANDLES.
- 哦亲爱的。
看看那些蜡烛。

21:09.448 --> 21:11.310
WHY, IF I WERE ANY OLDER,
为什么，如果我再老一点的话，

21:11.413 --> 21:14.586
WE'D BE IN DANGER
OF BURNING DOWN THE HOUSE.
我们有危险
烧毁房子。

21:14.689 --> 21:16.551
[Gary meows,
bell ringing]
[加里喵喵叫，
铃声响起]

21:16.655 --> 21:17.965
- GRAMMA, I GOT TO USE
YOUR PHONE AGAIN.
- 语法，我必须使用
又是你的手机。

21:18.068 --> 21:19.448
- OH, GO AHEAD, DEAR.
- 哦，继续吧，亲爱的。

21:19.551 --> 21:20.896
BUT THERE MAY NOT BE
ANY CAKE LEFT
但可能没有
剩下的蛋糕

21:21.000 --> 21:26.172
WHEN YOU GET BACK.
当你回来时。

21:26.275 --> 21:28.172
- [laughs]
- [笑]

21:28.275 --> 21:30.068
[phone rings]
[电话铃声]

21:30.172 --> 21:32.000
SQUAREYPANTS HOUSE.
方裤屋。

21:32.103 --> 21:34.068
- JUST CHECKING IN.
EVERYTHING OKAY OVER THERE?
- 刚刚登记入住。
那边一切都好吗？

21:34.172 --> 21:35.551
- WHO IS THIS?
- 这是谁？

21:35.655 --> 21:37.379
- IT'S SPONGEBOB.
IS GARY ALL RIGHT?
- 这是海绵宝宝。
加里还好吗？

21:37.482 --> 21:38.689
- OH, YEAH, HE--
- 哦，是的，他--

21:41.206 --> 21:42.413
- HE'S WHAT?
HE'S WHAT, PATRICK?
- 他是什么？
他是什么，帕特里克？

21:42.517 --> 21:43.413
GARY IS WHAT?
加里是什么？

21:43.517 --> 21:44.241
[both groaning]
[两人都呻吟]

21:44.344 --> 21:49.344
WHAT IS HAPPENING TO THEM?
他们发生了什么事？

21:49.448 --> 21:50.793
THEY NEED MY HELP!
他们需要我的帮助！

21:50.896 --> 21:53.275
GRAMMA! GRAMMA!
奶奶！奶奶！

21:53.379 --> 21:55.413
- HOLD ON, DEAR.
- 坚持住，亲爱的。

21:55.517 --> 21:57.413
JUST--JUST LET ME FINISH
就——让我说完

21:57.517 --> 22:00.137
THESE LAST FEW CANDLES.
最后几根蜡烛。

22:09.344 --> 22:11.068
I DID IT!
我做到了！

22:11.172 --> 22:14.620
OH, BUT--
OH, AM I TIRED.
哦，但是——
哦，我累了吗？

22:16.862 --> 22:18.137
- OOH, BETTER GET YOU
TO BED THEN.
- 哦，最好得到你
那就上床睡觉吧。

22:18.241 --> 22:19.103
GOOD NIGHT, GRAMMA.
晚安，奶奶。

22:19.206 --> 22:20.896
- WHAT A GOOD BOY.
- 真是个好孩子。

22:21.000 --> 22:22.551
- HANG ON, GARY!
- 坚持住，加里！

22:32.241 --> 22:33.103
GARY!
加里！

22:33.206 --> 22:34.689
- [distant meow]
- [远方喵]

22:34.793 --> 22:37.137
- WHA--!
WHAT'S THE MATTER, BUDDY?
- 世界卫生大会 - ！
出什么事了，伙计？

22:37.241 --> 22:40.068
- [meowing]
- [喵喵叫]

22:40.172 --> 22:43.413
- AH, READING PATRICK
A BEDTIME STORY, I SEE.
- 啊，读帕特里克
我明白了，这是一个睡前故事。

22:43.517 --> 22:45.034
SNAIL TAILS.
THAT'S A GOOD ONE.
蜗牛尾巴。
这是一件好事。

22:45.137 --> 22:47.379
- SNAIL TAILS?
- 蜗牛尾巴？

22:47.482 --> 22:49.620
I THOUGHT IT WAS CALLED
"MEOW, MEOW, MEOW."
我以为它叫
“喵、喵、喵。”

我以为它叫
“喵、喵、喵。”